WEBVTT

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.291
Search your workspace from one popup

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:05.408
Double Shift finds files, folders, text, symbols and commands

00:00:05.408 --> 00:00:07.315
Tab changes search mode and keeps your query

00:00:07.315 --> 00:00:10.025
Right Arrow previews code while search stays open

00:00:10.025 --> 00:00:13.517
Search file contents and jump to a matching line

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:16.728
Find functions, classes and other symbols

00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:19.641
Show usages: Cmd+Return on Mac / Ctrl+Enter on Windows and Linux

00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:23.833
Filter references by code or filename, then preview

00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:27.918
Back restores your search, results and selection

00:00:27.918 --> 00:00:33.291
Jump straight to a location with filename:line:column

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:36.371
Find VS Code commands in the same popup

00:00:36.371 --> 00:00:41.667
Customise tabs, sources and shortcuts in native VS Code Settings
